<description>&lt;p&gt;Fishermen who survived drone strikes at sea are suing the US over alleged attacks, claiming the strikes were manifestly unlawful. Journalist Tomás Beltrán was murdered outside his home, and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass. These incidents show that criminal groups linked to drug trafficking continue to target public figures and civilians across the country. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOUlY2b3JyZlNXQkttOUNVVWpqNVpBMTZsSzFMLUVGaTZiMElsc2g3R0JybHp2T2xvSGgyQnhkYVRkTy1GUUZEUU9JRlpsZlAyQnJwZTVtdWd5MTJ5bFJCSTdjdFRxNVM1aFJKUjB5WHVabFBfT2FuX3lrY3psbk81TW1YNGhCYTBzRnY2SWFaLTNQdUtEUmdBS09ENGEyVmxaVjE2T0c0M0g0b1NLSU9sWEJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQVWhGYWpiT0VyaFlYZVp5cklBVXYtNnp0QzZyMDNJSkdJQ2JiSUNSa2o3QVJROEd5eGxic3RtQmZUc2ZJQWxrVE1NYU5fWVJrRGFOSFo1dVVaU1JyS0Y4WndYVUp0SDBBV19lZU9BOVE0S3Ffb2tFMS13a3hCVDBBT2NFM3NSRlJQU1p4YTFxWDBpX1dxZnh0eUtmVXFuckl3R0VUUXowNnRiTld6Zm1UMHBSRU1QZlZxSDVWQk5B0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBVaEZhamJPRXJoWVhlWnlySUFVdi02enRDNnIwM0lKR0lDYmJJQ1JrajdBUlE4R3l4bGJzdG1CZlRzZklBbGtUTU1hTl9ZUmtEYU5IWjV1VVpTUnJLRjhad1hVSnRIMEFXX2VlT0E5UTRLcV9va0UxLXdreEJUMEFPY0Uzc1JGUlBTWnhhMXFYMGlfV3FmeHR5S2ZVcW5ySXdHRVRRejA2dGJOV3pmbVQwcFJFTVBmVnFINVZCTkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPdFVONnlSTmF4Rl9ISF9pLXlmWkZNd2M3NVdta1Y0Wm1SLVNMODk2Y0FIcVVscDBSaXFRUDc2NkNxMVFUQWNpbzZja3dyOGJzM0FLUjh1UXBBZWJhWnJuV2RrczJ0UVZOYl84VVZxNmc4ejBqV2ZNZnZPR2RmYnliM0RiVzllVkFxY0NKSGZqeWt6MWIwN2dOc0hQWjRZWktERHA5ZUExcFM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truthout&lt;/a&gt